    },
    {
      "text": "More than 300 feet below the surface, they build mazelike nests. Their activity can be destructive to subway tunnels.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s not uncommon for tunnels that appear to have formed naturally to actually be a result of Excadrill’s rampant digging.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Known as the Drill King, this Pokémon can tunnel through the terrain at speeds of over 90 mph.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
